flowchart TD
    A[Frontend Main Loop] --> B[Poll Host Events]
    B --> C[Inject Keyboard Event into Device]
    C --> D[CPU Step<br/>Fetch / Decode / Execute]
    D --> E[Memory Access<br/>RAM or MMIO]
    E --> F[Passive Device Reaction]
    F --> G[Interrupt Check]
    G --> H[Render Video Output]
    H --> A
